@startuml UML用例图_检票与管理员
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A5568
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #4A5568
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #4A5568
}
actor "检票员" as Inspector
actor "平台管理员" as Admin
rectangle "活动票务与报名系统" {
  usecase "登录/鉴权" as Login
  usecase "查看负责活动" as InspectorActivities
  usecase "处理检票请求" as ProcessCheck
  usecase "审核活动" as Review
  usecase "处理举报" as HandleReport
  usecase "封禁/解封账号" as Ban
  usecase "强制退票" as ForceRefund
  usecase "紧急取消活动" as EmergencyCancel
  usecase "查看全平台数据" as PlatformData
  usecase "查询审计" as Audit
  usecase "创建检票账号" as CreateInspector
}
Inspector --> Login
Admin --> Login
Inspector --> InspectorActivities
Inspector --> ProcessCheck
Admin --> Review
Admin --> HandleReport
Admin --> Ban
Admin --> ForceRefund
Admin --> EmergencyCancel
Admin --> PlatformData
Admin --> Audit
Admin --> CreateInspector
note right of Review
  审核申请可由发布、修改、
  取消申请触发。
end note
note right of ProcessCheck
  只处理自己负责活动的请求；
  不能修改报名状态。
end note
note bottom of Login
  所有角色先登录/鉴权；
  权限与数据范围由 A0～A4 + M7 控制。
end note
@enduml
